{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1360.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"bfe48e80b6c3f7dd954ba3de2682d4cf3399d60415d4c2c1507a028ed14710bb","ja":"役作りって言っても、台本を読み込んでイメージを\n膨らませたりだとか……。","zh":"虽说要塑造角色，但也只是仔细研读剧本、\n发挥想象之类的……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1360.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"749851d3df90cbc3f8e3417ca6a94a4eedfc05a8ef9d504e4fd25e3ed13c5d3e","ja":"足りない部分は、百合子さんに参考になりそうな本を\n借りて、補ったりしただけですよ。","zh":"不足的部分，我也只是向百合子小姐借了\n似乎能派上用场的书来弥补而已哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1360.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"72c016a51e45af0622fe0d9859e8334f47534fdd3ba98c478fa417503abace1b","ja":"えへへっ、私の本が役にたったのなら嬉しいな♪","zh":"嘿嘿，我的书能派上用场就太好啦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1360.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"c3642fda418e6e6b6325613d2c059191a73fb307c6c891dbc15121d43db8798a","ja":"すごいな～。本を読んで勉強するなんて、\n私にはできないかもっ。","zh":"好厉害啊～。看书学习这种事，\n我可能做不来呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1360.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"d8d90ba9c88d02d55d76f41a1772cc152ff459cff3ed4e4636916198647a389c","ja":"それは、さすがにどうかと思うわよ。","zh":"那不管怎么说也有点不妥吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1360.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"8554daebb4504ab09d935a5d845b38a26295e1ce141bb66fd1a6b9e7b2de1245","ja":"でもそれだと、性格についてだけだよね？\n動作はどうやって役作りしたの？","zh":"但那样的话，也只是针对性格吧？\n动作方面又是怎么进行角色塑造的呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1360.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"255066c540371085d191b963f76897072856f90739e91a81d7d869815d8a9a43","ja":"動作は、ドラマとかで\n男の俳優さんの動きを意識して見たりとか……。","zh":"动作方面，像是会在看电视剧之类的作品时，\n特意去观察男演员的举动……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1360.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"269f1f37ca4e2fa793c772040ca079783c73da68741ca039c732579fe6e5f042","ja":"あとは、身近な男の人をよく観察したり、ですね。","zh":"还有就是，好好观察身边的男性之类的呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1360.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"03c22d424899e17be10dfd535b79ae87d094a5779301e58d56047d4d2d4fddcf","ja":"なるほど、身近な男の人か……。","zh":"原来如此，身边的男性吗……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1360.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"61173e14c93ec098a9d732d12b3e9c26ce25b8a75bddb43a6b5dcdc0b94e9db8","ja":"それって、誰だろう？\n志保の弟だと、子どもっぽい感じになりそうだし……。","zh":"那是谁呢？\n要是志保的弟弟，感觉会显得比较幼稚……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1360.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"7f0e1cbdc1294c96f8a699e6b6221d9104e2d0292d49a0fa77a277f6d411c687","ja":"べ、別に誰だって……。","zh":"才、才不是因为特定的人……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
